about you making a movie in the States.

52
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:06,000
Vous pouvez nous en dire un peu plus ?
Could you tell us a bit more?

53
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:09,400
C'est tout à fait off the record, hein ?
This is totally off the record, okay?

54
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:11,000
Entre nous.
Just between us.

55
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:16,613
Rien n'est signé pour l'instant. On attend l'appel de L.A.
Nothing has been signed yet. We're waiting for the call from L.A.

56
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:19,680
-Et ? -Bon, je vais vous dire.
-And?
-Okay, I'll tell you.

57
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:22,200
-Oui ? -C'est le prochain film de Tarantino.
-Yes?
-It's Tarantino's next movie.

58
00:03:23,640 --> 00:03:24,520
Fantastique !
Fantastic!

59
