Ça s'appelle Revenge of the Immortal.
It's called Revenge of the Immortal.

60
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:28,800
C'est l'histoire d'une cow-girl
It's about a cowgirl

61
00:03:28,880 --> 00:03:30,520
qui devient immortel et...
who becomes immortal and...

62
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:32,520
Désolé Gabriel, changement de stratégie.
So sorry Gabriel, strategy change.

63
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:35,680
Quentin Tarantino ne prendra pas Cécile de France dans son film.
Quentin Tarantino won't be casting
Cécile de France in his film.

64
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,564
Problème d'âge. Désolé.
Problem with her age. Sorry.

65
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:42,640
Oh, merde !
Oh, fuck!

66
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:45,720
Ouais, c'est super.
Yeah, that's great.

67
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:49,720
Donc c'est une grosse production hollywoodienne.
So it's a big Hollywood production.

68
00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:54,080
Ouais, c'est... C'est comme un rêve pour moi,
Yeah, it's... It's like a dream for me,

69
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:55,840
de travailler avec Tarantino.
working with Tarantino.

