Has anyone called Marion Touitout back?

106
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:46,960
Soit jeudi à quatorze heures...
Either Thursday at two...

107
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:50,320
soit vendredi à onze heures. Okay.
or Friday at 11. Okay.

108
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,440
-Bonjour. -Bonjour.
-Hello.
-Hello.

109
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:54,600
Je suis là pour voir Mathias Barneville.
I'm here to see Mathias Barneville.

110
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,920
Il vous attend ?
Is he expecting you?

111
00:06:57,320 --> 00:06:58,880
Non, mais c'est important.
No, but it's important.

112
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:02,680
Laissez vos photos et votre CV ici.
Leave your photos and résumé here.

113
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:07,960
Écoutez, cette agence ne représente que des stars.
Look, this agency has nothing but stars.

114
