Alors ne vous faites pas d'illusions.
So don't kid yourself.

115
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:13,200
Je ne suis pas actrice. Je veux juste voir Mathias.
I'm not an actress.
I just want to see Mathias.

116
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:16,320
Votre nom ?
Your name?

117
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,080
Camille Valentini.
Camille Valentini.

118
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:19,560
Il me connaît.
He knows me.

119
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:22,360
Mathias, sans rendez-vous...
Mathias, without an appointment...

120
00:07:22,840 --> 00:07:25,320
Je ne promets rien. Asseyez-vous.
I'm not promising anything. Have a seat.

121
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:29,880
Mathias, Camille Valentini est là.
Mathias, Camille Valentini is here.

122
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:31,320
Désolée de vous déranger.
Sorry to bother you.

123
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:45,720
Bonjour, Camille.
Hello, Camille.

124
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:47,920
Entrez.
Come.

125
00:07:56,880 --> 00:07:58,480
Un café, s'il vous plaît.
Coffee, please.

126
00:07:58,840 --> 00:08:00,400
-Très bien. Et vous ? -Un thé ?
-Very well. And you?
-Tea?

127
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:01,520
-D'accord. -Merci.
-Okay.
-Thanks.

128
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:06,760
Pourquoi tu n'as pas appelé ?
Why didn't you call?

129
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:10,640
Je sais pas. Je voulais te faire la surprise.
I don't know. I wanted to surprise you.

130
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,320
Qu'est-ce que tu as dit à l'accueil ?
What did you say at reception?

131
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,280
Que je voulais te voir.
I wanted to see you.

132
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,280
Je ne suis pas stupide.
I'm not stupid.

133
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:20,920
C'est sympa ici.
It's nice here.

134
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,360
Des sucettes gratuites.
Free lollipops.

135
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:25,040
C'est du sucre pour le café.
It's sugar for the coffee.

136
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:27,280
Ah, d'accord.
Oh, okay.

137
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:31,360
Qu'est-ce que tu fais à Paris ? Tu es en vacances ?
What are you doing in Paris?
Are you on vacation?

138
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:33,600
-En quelque sorte. -C'est-à-dire ?
-Sort of.
-What do you mean?

139
00:08:34,160 --> 00:08:36,520
Ça fait trois semaines que je suis là.
I've been here three weeks now.

140
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:39,360
Je m'installe, j'essaie...
Living here, giving it a go...

141
