Pourquoi ? Tu n'aimais pas à Mandelieu ?
Why? Didn't you like it in Mandelieu?

142
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:44,000
C'est un bel endroit.
It's a lovely place.

143
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:47,320
Les gens rêvent de vivre sur la Côte d'Azur.
People dream of living on the Côte d’Azur.

144
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:49,160
Toi, tu n'en as jamais voulu.
You've never wanted to.

145
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:53,000
-T'avais un bon boulot. -Ah oui ?
-You had a good job.
-Oh, yeah?

146
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:54,720
C'était quoi ?
What was it?

147
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:57,800
Vendre des sous-vêtements lors de soirées à domicile.
Selling underwear at home parties.

148
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:02,840
Merci.
Thanks.

149
00:09:11,680 --> 00:09:14,720
T'as trouvé un appartement ? Un travail ?
Have you found an apartment? A job?

150
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:17,640
Oui, un petit loft.
Yeah, a small loft apartment.

151
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:21,480
Et je cherche du boulot.
And I'm looking for a job.

152
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:24,960
Alors je me suis dit que, comme tu connais beaucoup de monde dans le cinéma,
So I thought that, as you know
lots of people in the film industry,

153
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:26,240
tu pourrais m'aider.
you could help me.

154
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:30,600
Un nouveau caprice ?
A new fad?

155
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:32,720
C'est pas un caprice, je suis sérieuse.
It's not a fad, I'm serious.

156
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:35,560
J'ai toujours adoré le cinéma.
I've always loved films.

157
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,480
Je m'en fiche de ce que je fais.
I don't mind what I do.

158
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:40,320
Poser du scotch pour que l'acteur sache où se placer,
Put tape down
so the actor knows where to stand,

159
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,800
tenir leurs parapluies,
hold their umbrellas,

160
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:43,440
aller chercher des cafés, des sushis, de la coke...
fetch coffee, sushi, cocaine...

161
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:45,960
-Je sais que c'est pour moi. -Écoute,
-I know it's for me.
-Look,

162
00:09:46,040 --> 00:09:49,280
c'est pas quelque chose qu'on fait comme ça, comme la danse ou le judo.
it's not just something you do,
like dancing or judo.

163
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:51,280
-Je sais. -C'est une industrie,
-I know.
-It's an industry,

164
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:52,800
et elle est pleine de requins.
and it's full of sharks.

165
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:55,920
Soit tu dévores les autres, soit tu te fais dévorer.
Either you eat everyone else
or you get eaten.

166
00:09:56,040 --> 00:09:57,320
C'est tellement difficile !
It's so difficult!

167
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:58,520
Super !
Great!

168
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:02,760
Si t'aimes autant le cinéma,
If you love the movies that much,

169
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:04,720
