Désolé, c'est tout ce que je peux faire.
I'm sorry, that's all I can do.

171
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:23,840
Oui, mais je ne savais pas !
Yes, but I didn't know!

172
00:10:23,920 --> 00:10:25,560
Bon, alors, deux fois...
Okay, then, twice...

173
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,360
Désolé, Samuel.
Sorry, Samuel.

174
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:33,560
Lèche-bottes !
Bootlicker!

175
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:37,120
Chapeau l'artiste !
Hats off to the artist!

176
00:10:41,680 --> 00:10:43,520
Je pars en vacances, pas à la retraite.
I'm going on vacation, not retiring.

177
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:46,080
Premières vacances en huit ans.
First vacation in eight years.

178
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:52,680
Baisse-la pour t'empêcher d'appeler tes clients.
Pull it down
to stop you phoning your clients.

179
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:57,320
T'as pas envie d'entendre ces types se plaindre pendant deux semaines.
You don't want to hear these guys whining
for two weeks.

180
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,880
Bois des caipirinhas et des mojitos...
Drink caipirinhas and mojitos...

181
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:02,880
regarder les fesses des filles et dire bonjour à Pelé.
look at girls' asses,
and say hello to Pelé.

182
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:04,960
-Pourquoi seulement regarder ? -Comme vous voulez.
-Why only look?
-As you like.

183
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:08,920
Merci à tous.
Thank you, everyone.

